"הקצה יאסוף אותה בבדיקה הבאה שלו."

#: app.py:3448
msgid "Unknown action."
msgstr "פעולה לא מוכרת."

#: app.py:3955
msgid ""
"No destination is available for this incident (no linked Alert with a "
"recorded domain/IP, and this is not a manual IP reputation incident with "
